/* ==========================================================================
   STORE PAGES: cart, checkout, thank-you, product list
   Everything above styles the product page (written by the developer).
   Everything below gives GHL's own store pages the same dark Somadome look.
   ========================================================================== */
.sd-native-hidden{display:none!important}

/* Note: ":not(#_)" changes nothing visually. It only makes these rules strong
